  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Draw on the Thalassic Power of the Deeps</p></blockquote><p>You have plunged into a pact with the deeps. An entity of the ocean, the Elemental Plane of Water, or another otherworldly sea now lets you draw on its thalassic power. Is it merely using you to learn about terrestrial realms, or does it want you to open cosmic floodgates and drown the world? Perhaps you were born into a generational cult that venerates the Fathomless and its spawn, or you were shipwrecked and drowning when your patron's grasp offered you a chance at life. Entities of the deep that might empower a Warlock include krakens, ancient water elementals, and godlike beings of the abyss.</p><p><em>The Fathomless of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn: features at Warlock levels 3, 6, 10, and 14, and always-prepared Fathomless Spells.</em></p><h3>Fathomless Patron Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.4Q5Opl5l3NrMgxMy]{Fathomless Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.nI4pgeId45UeHoKE]{Tentacle of the Deeps}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.mNTARq2sXXwOcElb]{Gift of the Sea}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.oP0ZmC4TPOpS7cV8]{Oceanic Soul}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.bHp9n6FPxJ54NIdB]{Guardian Coil}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.vLzjNfGPUB70oPcb]{Grasping Tentacles}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.C5JT1bsiSR657QfG]{Fathomless Plunge}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Fathomless Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Warlock Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCreateorDe]{Create or Destroy Water}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGustofWind]{Gust of Wind}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSilence000]{Silence}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplThunderwav]{Thunderwave}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLightningB]{Lightning Bolt}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSleetStorm]{Sleet Storm}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplControlWat]{Control Water}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.pPR71jJhl0iussW0]{Summon Elemental}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBigbysHand]{Bigby's Hand}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConeofCold]{Cone of Cold}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
